Calling `get_event_type` with three arguments, or `process_payment_webhook` with three, is
E0061. There is NO `transformation_status` field and NO `WebhookTransformationStatus` type
anywhere in the tree - any snippet that sets one is E0560; delete it.

Source verification is a separate, NON-GENERIC trait: implement `SourceVerification` once for
the connector (`impl<T: ...> SourceVerification for {ConnectorName}<T> {}`), never once per
flow. Same for `BodyDecoding`. See Part F above.

